[h2]Jump[/h2]
Press [b]V[/b] (Arma's Step Over binding) while running to jump. At walking speed or when standing still, the key still steps over obstacles. The jump works from a standing or crouched run. Press the crouch key in the air to change the stance you land in. It also works on units controlled remotely by Zeus.

Jump speed is 1× by default and can be set from 0.1× to 10×.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Jump[/b] module to use it in that scenario. A trigger can turn the module on and off. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Jump[/b], check [b]Enable Jump[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

